      "prompt": "Analyze the SME context for activity and asset inventory, coverage gaps, overlaps, outdated sums, and broker questions. Extract the most important facts, weak signals, constraints, assumptions, risks, and evidence gaps. Estimate likely impact qualitatively when numbers are missing. Do not invent facts. Return JSON only.",
      "tooling": {
        "prompt_execution": {
          "execute_prompt": true,
          "selected": true,
